  "intro": {
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text": "Organisations operating frontier AI labs and models in Australia face potential mandatory incident reporting, independent audits, model sharing with safety and security agencies, and a new licensing framework under a parliamentary committee's new report.",
        "cites": [
          "7396ed9251e0fddc",
          "6e1f21ad7bac31cf"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At the same time, a Senate inquiry report on the Digital Duty of Care Bill signals a shift toward outcomes-based regulation that may require broader risk management frameworks.",
        "cites": [
          "4091a870daa91f99"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Additionally, developers and security teams can now utilize new runtime protection tools and proposed industry-wide pretraining metrics to support safety standards and continuous assurance.",
        "cites": [
          "b0689cf87ab570a4",
          "1a10f1676d46fc01"
        ]
      }
    ],
